WEBVTT

00:06:28.167 --> 00:06:31.351
The secret lies

00:06:31.375 --> 00:06:34.601
in turning our backs to one another,

00:06:34.625 --> 00:06:38.309
and I know that that sounds
absolutely like the opposite

00:06:38.333 --> 00:06:40.309
of what you were expecting,

00:06:40.333 --> 00:06:44.643
but when in a relationship
you turn your back to your partner

00:06:44.667 --> 00:06:47.393
and place your back upon their back --

00:06:47.417 --> 00:06:49.976
(Laughter)

00:06:50.000 --> 00:06:52.101
you eliminate visual cues.

00:06:52.125 --> 00:06:53.309
(Laughter)

00:06:53.333 --> 00:06:55.917
(Applause)

00:06:58.292 --> 00:07:01.309
You are more readily available